  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​1. Platform Overview​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​1. Platform Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 22.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Picom365 is ScImage's flagship cloud-based imaging platform, used across​\n​radiology, cardiology, vascular medicine, women's health, and several other​\n​clinical specialties. It's built as a suite of interconnected web applications​\n​and modules rather than a single monolithic app, all accessed through a​\n​common login portal at picom365.com.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​1. Platform Overview​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2. High-Level Workflow​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 22.0,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​At a high level, an exam or study moves through the platform in five stages:​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​Acquisition & Upload — Images/exams enter the system from​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​modalities, mobile capture, or web upload.​\n​●​ ​Worklist & Routing — Studies are organized, prioritized, and routed to​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​the right reader.​\n​●​ ​Viewing & Diagnosis — Clinicians review images using​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​specialty-specific viewers and tools.​\n​●​ ​Reporting — Findings are documented, either through built-in or​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​external reporting systems.​\n​●​ ​Distribution, Sharing & Analytics — Results and images are shared​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​with referring providers/patients, and usage/outcomes data is tracked​\n​centrally.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Administration (user accounts, permissions) and interoperability with​\n​outside systems (EHRs, other PACS, HL7 feeds) run underneath all five​\n​stages rather than as a separate step.​",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2. High-Level Workflow​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2.1 Acquisition & Upload​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.1 Acquisition & Upload​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​PicomCloud — a web-based upload portal for submitting patient​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.1 Acquisition & Upload​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​exams directly, without needing local PACS infrastructure.​\n​●​ ​PicomCam — a mobile app that lets staff capture photos on a​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.1 Acquisition & Upload​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​phone/tablet and upload them straight into the PACS, used heavily in​\n​specialties like wound care, dermatology, or endoscopy where​\n​photographic documentation matters.​\n​●​ ​Modality-originated studies (CT, MRI, ultrasound, echo, etc.) flow in​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.1 Acquisition & Upload​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​through standard DICOM and non-DICOM ingestion, since the​\n​platform is built to handle both.​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.1 Acquisition & Upload​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2.2 Worklist & Routing​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.2 Worklist & Routing​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​A smart worklist dynamically prioritizes urgent cases (STAT/ASAP) and auto-routes​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.2 Worklist & Routing​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​studies by modality, subspecialty, or site.​\n​●​ ​Automated alerts notify assigned readers of time-sensitive studies, with per-user tracking​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.2 Worklist & Routing​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​configurable down to the hour or minute.​\n​●​ ​A built-in patient/study identifier crosswalk lets the system reconcile records across​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.2 Worklist & Routing​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​multiple EHRs or multiple radiology groups serving one institution, which matters for​\n​multi-site or multi-tenant deployments.​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.2 Worklist & Routing​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​Viewing is delivered through specialty-tuned dashboards under the shared​\n​PicomWeb front end, rather than one generic viewer:​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​Radiology — zero-footprint 2D/3D viewing, AI-assisted hanging​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​protocols and prior-study surfacing, MPR/MIP and image fusion, and​\n​integration hooks into external advanced-visualization/quantification​\n​tools.​\n​●​ ​Cardiology — workflows spanning invasive and diagnostic cardiology.​\n​●​ ​Vascular — support for both invasive and non-invasive vascular​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​imaging workflows.​\n​●​ ​Women's Health — dedicated handling for OB, MFM (maternal-fetal​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​medicine), and mammography studies.​",
    "page": 4,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​Other departments — ophthalmology, endoscopy, dermatology, and​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​pathology are supported through the same underlying platform.​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.3 Viewing & Diagnosis​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2.4 Reporting​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.4 Reporting​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​Structured Reporting — configurable templates for generating​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.4 Reporting​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​standardized reports, aimed at specialties with data-rich exam types​\n​(e.g., cardiology).​\n​●​ ​Voice-enabled self-reporting, using built-in speech recognition, for​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.4 Reporting​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​dictation directly inside the platform.​\n​●​ ​External reporting integration — the platform can either launch a​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.4 Reporting​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​third-party reporting system from within PACS, or be launched/driven​\n​from an external system, so sites aren't locked into one reporting tool.​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.4 Reporting​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "​2.5 Distribution, Sharing & Analytics​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.5 Distribution, Sharing & Analytics​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​●​ ​PicomShare — lets external physicians and patients submit or​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.5 Distribution, Sharing & Analytics​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​receive exams, functioning as the platform's exam-exchange front​\n​door.​\n​●​ ​Secure image sharing — web-link-based, PHI-protected distribution​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.5 Distribution, Sharing & Analytics​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "​intended to replace physical media (CDs), aimed at cutting​\n​unnecessary re-imaging, radiation exposure, turnaround time, and​\n​cost.​\n​●​ ​PicomAnalytics — a reporting/analytics module for tracking worker​",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "​COMPANY PROFILE​",
      "​2.5 Distribution, Sharing & Analytics​"
    ],
    "metadata": {
